Third-party material
--------------------

No font, image, icon set or other third-party asset is distributed in this
repository.

- Fonts. The tokens name "Inter" and "JetBrains Mono" in their font stacks;
  a browser uses them only when they are installed, otherwise the system
  font. No font file is shipped or loaded from a CDN. Both fonts are
  licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 by their authors
  (https://github.com/rsms/inter, https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono).
  An Organization that ships the font files in its own module adds their
  license there.
- Icons. The icons are original paths on a 24 x 24 grid. The iconography page
  names Lucide (ISC license) only as an example of an open icon set an
  Organization may choose; no Lucide file is included.
- Dependencies. The viewer installs its npm dependencies at preparation time
  (app/v1/package.json, app/v1/bun.lock); they are not part of this
  repository and keep their own licenses: Astro, @astrojs/check and
  @astrojs/markdown-remark (MIT), @lazurio/module-kit (MIT), TypeScript
  (Apache-2.0), Biome (MIT OR Apache-2.0) and @types/bun (MIT). The static
  build contains the client scripts the viewer itself writes and the code
  Astro and Vite generate for them.
